{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわ．"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川村 まひろです.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東北ツアーから戻ってきても，名古屋や京都等... ほとんど東京に居ない状況ですね♡ぇへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中まずは，名古屋での個別握手会の私服です．"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2016/05/06/2193668/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白のぴったりしたトップスに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ターコイズブルーのスカート.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シルバーのピンヒール.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このスカートすごく綺麗...♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お店で一目惚れし購入してしまいました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこれからね，"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わんこ達を机に飾って握手会することになったよU・x・U"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず初めての名古屋では，お家にずっと飾っていたこの3匹♡わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2016/05/06/2193668/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいーでしょ♡？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柴犬とポメラニアン♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3匹ともファンの皆さんから頂いたものです.＊   お花の中に埋もれてたのU・x・U"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下の柴犬は「マリ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポメラニアンは「サスケ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マリは和歌山のじいじいん家の柴犬の名前がマリだから．  ポメラニアンは私の家族だったポメラニアンのサスケ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから少しずつ増えていくかも♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前は私1人で決めれないから，皆で決めましょーねー．"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七瀬の方のサスケ，マント着てる♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2016/05/06/2193668/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい，そして昨日は京都でした♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元関西～.＊  ただいま～．"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都の私服は..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2016/05/06/2193668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノースリーブのハイネックニット♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デニムスカート♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋とはまた違った感じよぉ."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2016/05/06/2193668/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぁ... あのね，京都ね，"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンコ達持って行くの忘れたのーー．笑  ごめんね."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手しに来てくれた皆さんありがとうございます.＊  皆の優しい人柄が伝わりました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも応援してくれてありがとう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また早く会いたいです.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてね，昨日，5月5日は，サスケの命日でした.   私は握手会だったからサスケに会いに行けなかったけど，両親は行ってきたみたいで，写真だけ送ってもらいました^ ^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今さっき，サスケの事を思い出して「ひまわりの約束」を歌ってきたんだけど，涙がとまらんかった."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サスケには沢山救ってもらったからね... 沢山笑顔にしてくれて， 沢山心を癒してくたのよ．"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっとね，今も天国で走り回ってると思う．  ひまわり畑でね.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サスケがお墓に入る時ね，沢山のヒマワリに囲まれて優しい顔で寝てたの♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今でも私の心の中ではサスケが走り回ってます♡ぇへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サスケ、これからも元気でねーヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また更新します."}],"source":"archive"}